  "releaseNotes": "## 1.2.3\n- FireAndForgetPublishStrategy: replaced Task.Run with System.Threading.Channels for bounded/unbounded producer-consumer message dispatch\n- FireAndForgetPublishStrategy: simplified, removed inner strategy dependency; subscribers are invoked directly via Parallel.ForEachAsync in the channel consumer\n- FireAndForgetPublishStrategy: added ILogger support for error logging on subscriber exceptions\n- AddFireAndForgetMessagePublisher registration: simplified signature, added optional channelCapacity parameter",
